            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changed
- **Chat is now opt-in.** Turn on Settings > General > Chat > Enable Chat to get the Terminal | Chat choice in task preparation and the task header. With it off, new sessions open in the terminal and the pickers are hidden. A task already in chat keeps its picker so it can switch back to the terminal.
]]></description>
